      <td>The user and the AI system plan and carry out the work together, and either can take the lead.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr id="table-aisystem-autonomylevel-consultant">
      <td>http://data.europa.eu/it6/codelist/autonomyLevel/consultant</td>
      <td>consultant</td>
      <td>Consultant</td>
      <td>The AI system leads and asks the user for input where it needs expertise or preferences.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr id="table-aisystem-autonomylevel-approver">
      <td>http://data.europa.eu/it6/codelist/autonomyLevel/approver</td>
      <td>approver</td>
      <td>Approver</td>
      <td>The AI system acts on its own and asks the user for approval before risky or irreversible actions.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr id="table-aisystem-autonomylevel-observer">
      <td>http://data.europa.eu/it6/codelist/autonomyLevel/observer</td>
      <td>observer</td>
      <td>Observer</td>
      <td>The AI system acts on its own and the user only monitors it and can step in or stop it.</td>
    </tr>
